---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="FAQ — Smile Savers Dental"
  description="Dental FAQs answered by Smile Savers Dental in Woodside, NY. Pain-free visits, insurance, appointments: (718) 956-8400."
  headerClass="transparent header-light"
>
  <section id="subheader" class="bg-color-op-1 text-center">
    <div class="container relative z-2">
      <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <h1 class="wow fadeInUp">FAQ</h1>
          <div class="border-bottom my-3"></div>
          <ul class="crumb wow fadeInDown">
            <li>
              <a href="/">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="active">FAQ</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4 gx-5 justify-content-center wow fadeInUp">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <div class="de-tab plain">
            <ul class="d-tab-nav mb-4 border-bottom pb-4 d-flex justify-content-between">
              <li class="active-tab">General Care</li>
              <li>Cosmetic Dentistry</li>
              <li>Restorative Dentistry</li>
              <li>Insurance &amp; Appointments</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="d-tab-content text-start py-4">
              <li>
                <div class="accordion-section">
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-a1">
                    How often should I visit the dentist?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-a1">
                    We recommend visiting every 6 months for routine checkups and professional
                    cleanings. Some patients with specific oral health concerns may benefit from
                    more frequent visits — our team will guide you during your first appointment.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-a2">
                    What should I expect during my first visit?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-a2">
                    Your first visit includes a comprehensive exam, digital X-rays, and a
                    professional cleaning. We will discuss your dental history, address any
                    concerns, and create a personalised treatment plan tailored to your needs and
                    goals.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-a3">
                    What can I do about dental anxiety?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-a3">
                    Dental anxiety is extremely common, and our entire team is trained to help. We
                    use a gentle approach, take time to explain every step, and can accommodate
                    various comfort needs. Please let us know before your appointment so we can
                    prepare.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-a4">
                    What should I do in a dental emergency?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-a4">
                    Call us immediately at (718) 956-8400 — we offer same-day emergency appointments
                    for urgent issues like severe toothaches, broken or knocked-out teeth, or dental
                    trauma.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-a5">
                    Do you offer emergency dental services?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-a5">
                    Absolutely. We offer same-day emergency appointments for urgent issues like
                    severe toothaches, broken or knocked-out teeth, or dental trauma. Call us
                    immediately at (718) 956-8400 and we will do our best to see you the same day.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>

              <li>
                <div class="accordion-section">
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-b1">
                    How much whiter will my teeth get?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-b1">
                    Professional whitening at Smile Savers uses prescription-strength gel and
                    typically lightens teeth 4–8 shades in a single visit — far more than
                    over-the-counter kits.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-b2">
                    How long do veneers last?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-b2">
                    Porcelain veneers typically last 10–20 years with good oral hygiene and routine
                    check-ups. We'll give you care instructions to maximise their lifespan.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-b3">
                    Is whitening safe for sensitive teeth?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-b3">
                    Yes. We offer desensitising treatments alongside whitening and tailor the gel
                    concentration to your sensitivity level. Many patients with sensitive teeth
                    complete treatment comfortably.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-b4">
                    Can I whiten if I have crowns or fillings?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-b4">
                    Whitening works on natural enamel only. If you have existing restorations, we'll
                    discuss how to achieve a uniform shade across your whole smile.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>

              <li>
                <div class="accordion-section">
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-c1">
                    What is CEREC same-day crown technology?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-c1">
                    CEREC uses 3D digital scanning and in-office milling to design and create a
                    custom porcelain crown in a single appointment — no temporaries, no second
                    visit. Most crowns are ready within 90 minutes.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-c2">
                    What are my options for replacing missing teeth?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-c2">
                    We offer single tooth implants, implant-supported bridges and All-on-4 full-arch
                    restoration. Dr. Bhagat, a Diplomate of the International Congress of Oral
                    Implantologists (ICOI) since 2004, brings over two decades of implant expertise.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-c3">
                    Does root canal treatment hurt?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-c3">
                    No — with modern techniques our root canal treatment is pain-free and relieves
                    dental pain while saving your infected tooth.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-c4">
                    Am I a candidate for dental implants?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-c4">
                    Most adults with good general health are candidates. We'll evaluate your bone
                    density, gum health, and overall health to determine if implants are right for
                    you.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-c5">
                    How long do dental implants last?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-c5">
                    With proper care, dental implants can last a lifetime. The crown may need
                    replacement after 10-15 years due to normal wear.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>

              <li>
                <div class="accordion-section">
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-d1">
                    Do you accept my dental insurance?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-d1">
                    Yes — we accept most major dental insurance plans including Delta Dental, Cigna,
                    Aetna, MetLife, Guardian, and United Healthcare. Call us on (718) 956-8400 to
                    verify your specific coverage.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-d2">
                    Which plans are in-network?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-d2">
                    Delta Dental, Cigna, Aetna and MetLife are in-network, plus Guardian, United
                    Healthcare, Humana, Principal, Anthem, Empire Blue Cross, Medicaid/CHIP child
                    plans and most PPO plans.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-d3">
                    How does insurance verification work?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-d3">
                    Share your insurance card, we verify your benefits before your visit, give you a
                    clear cost estimate upfront, and submit all claims for you.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-d4">
                    What if I don't have insurance?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-d4">
                    We accept major credit cards, CareCredit with interest-free 6 or 12 month
                    options, cash/check discounts, and in-house payment plans.
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-title" data-tab="#accordion-d5">
                    How do I book?
                  </div>
                  <div class="accordion-section-content" id="accordion-d5">
                    Schedule online in minutes — our team confirms within 24 hours. Most patients
                    are booked within 24 hours. Emergency? Call (718) 956-8400.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
